WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2, Scene 07h: Lunar Gate launch sequence
Duration: ~20 seconds
Source: FF8 FMV — pod interior, launch, ascent toward moon

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Inside a gold and teal cockpit, looking forward down the launch rail. The pod is loaded and ready.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The launch mechanism engages. Machinery labeled Tin Can Shooter surrounds the rail, golden rings spinning.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Blinding white-blue acceleration. The pod fires from the rail at tremendous speed.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
The pod streaks upward trailing fire, the enormous moon filling the sky ahead.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The Lunar Gate launch rail curves across the horizon at dusk, the moon looming above.
